    "q-163283": {
      "dom_id": "step-q163283",
      "name": "Question 13",
      "problem": "Consider a thin plate $D$ that has the mass density function $\\lambda (x,y)=x-y$ and is enclosed between the curve $x=-y$ and the $y$-axis for $-1\\le y\\le 0.$ Given that the mass of the plate is $\\frac{1}{2}$ units and its center of mass is located at $(\\overset{―}{x},\\overset{―}{y}),$ what is the value of $\\overset{―}{y}?$",
      "worked_solution": "The center of mass of a lamina $D$ with the mass density function $\\lambda (x,y)$ is given by \n\n$$\n(\\overset{―}{x},\\overset{―}{y})=(\\frac{{M}_{y}}{m},\\frac{{M}_{x}}{m}),\n$$\n\nwhere \n\n- $m={∬}_{D}\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A$ is the mass of the lamina,\n\n- ${M}_{x}={∬}_{D}y\\,\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A\\,$ is the moment of the lamina about the $x$-axis, and\n\n- ${M}_{y}={∬}_{D}x\\,\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A$ is the moment of the lamina about the $y$-axis.\n\nNotice that $D$ is a type II plane region:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14121640/assets/e01f73436854c4d337f4fa1dfbb31645c99ccdccbd4e36ae5145305f8b7b4a1f.png)\n\nSo, we have \n\n$$\nD={(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le -y,\\,-1\\le y\\le 0}\n$$\n\nand $\\lambda (x,y)=x-y.$ \n\nSince we require the $y$-coordinate of the center of mass, we need to compute the moment about the $x$-axis: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{x} & ={∬}_{D}y\\,\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}y\\cdot (x-y)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}xy-{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{0}{\\int }_{0}^{-y}xy-{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{0}{[\\frac{{x}^{2}y}{2}-x{y}^{2}]}_{x=0}^{x=-y}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{0}\\frac{{y}^{3}}{2}+{y}^{3}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{0}\\frac{3{y}^{3}}{2}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={[\\frac{3{y}^{4}}{8}]}_{y=-1}^{y=0} \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{8}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{y}=\\frac{{M}_{x}}{m}=\\frac{(-\\frac{3}{8})}{(\\frac{1}{2})}=-\\frac{3}{4}.\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
